    "body": "## Summary\n\n- route all five application abuse budgets through one configurable fixed-window backend\n- use an atomic Redis Lua increment/expiry decision with HMAC-pseudonymized keys and server-side TTLs\n- fail closed on Redis outages for limited HTTP and STOMP work\n- wire a private authenticated Redis service into local and production Compose with health-gated startup\n- prove cross-instance sharing and concurrency against a real Redis service in CI\n- update deployment/security documentation and complete roadmap items #624, #625 and #942\n\n## Verification\n\n- `git diff --check`\n- YAML parse for both Compose files, both Spring configuration files and CI workflow\n- `bash -n .github/scripts/production-compose-contract-smoke.sh`\n- GitHub Actions supply-chain pin contract (28 references)\n- roadmap invariant: 965 items = 625 ✅ + 2 🟢 + 75 🟡 + 263 🔴\n- full Maven, Compose and runtime verification delegated to this PR's GitHub Actions gate",
